WEBVTT

00:43.586 --> 00:48.506
[GRISHA TITAN grunting]

00:54.806 --> 00:58.636
Why is there still so much
you refuse to show me?

00:58.726 --> 01:01.266
I never saw
the fall of the walls.

01:01.356 --> 01:07.236
What becomes of my home?
Is Carla going to make it?

01:07.316 --> 01:09.486
Was there no other way forward?

01:09.566 --> 01:12.276
Was this really
the right choice?

01:15.496 --> 01:19.246
[GRISHA] You're here
watching me now, right, Zeke?

01:20.206 --> 01:21.326
[GRISHA]
From here on out,

01:21.416 --> 01:24.376
nothing is going to go
the way you'd hoped.

01:24.456 --> 01:27.376
Eren will get
everything he wants.

01:27.466 --> 01:29.586
What do you mean?
How could you know--?

01:29.676 --> 01:31.136
[GRISHA]
I've seen it.

01:31.216 --> 01:33.386
I've witnessed Eren's memories.

01:33.466 --> 01:35.096
What humanity is about to endure

01:35.176 --> 01:37.806
is far worse than
I could imagine.

01:37.886 --> 01:40.556
[GRISHA gasps]
Zeke.

01:42.356 --> 01:44.646
That's you, right, Zeke?

01:44.726 --> 01:46.686
You've gotten so big!

01:47.646 --> 01:48.816
I'm sorry.

01:48.896 --> 01:52.066
I know I was never
the father you deserved.

01:52.156 --> 01:53.986
After all I put you through,

01:54.076 --> 01:56.656
you have every right
to despise me.

01:58.906 --> 02:04.586
[Sobs] But even so.
I will always love you.

02:04.666 --> 02:07.506
If only I'd let you be my son

02:07.586 --> 02:10.756
instead of trying to
make you a soldier!

02:10.836 --> 02:17.216
[GRISHA sobbing]

02:29.566 --> 02:32.106
Oh, Father.

02:32.196 --> 02:36.986
Please, Zeke.
You have to stop Eren.

02:37.076 --> 02:38.246
[ZEKE gasps]

02:39.196 --> 02:40.156
[Groans]

02:42.826 --> 02:44.326
[Gasps]

02:46.246 --> 02:48.336
It's a shame we couldn't
stick around long enough

02:48.416 --> 02:50.506
to watch me eat him.

02:51.876 --> 02:53.676
It was all you?

02:53.756 --> 02:56.676
Father followed through,
attacked the king of the walls,

02:56.756 --> 02:58.966
and challenged
the world because

02:59.056 --> 03:01.306
you pushed him to?

03:01.386 --> 03:03.596
If what he said
back then is true...

03:03.686 --> 03:06.566
If you can transcend time
with the Attack Titan's power,

03:06.646 --> 03:08.226
then he only would have
seen whatever memories

03:08.316 --> 03:10.226
you chose to show him.

03:10.316 --> 03:13.656
You could manipulate him
into changing the past!

03:13.736 --> 03:16.116
Our father, Grisha,
was on the verge of

03:16.196 --> 03:19.116
completing the
Restorationists' mission.

03:19.196 --> 03:20.946
And then he got cold feet.

03:21.036 --> 03:23.036
He was scared of
losing his family.

03:23.116 --> 03:26.956
Realizing even if he took
the Founder, he couldn't use it.

03:27.036 --> 03:29.296
But he did,
despite knowing that,

03:29.376 --> 03:31.506
and he entrusted it to you.

03:31.586 --> 03:35.506
Because he'd witnessed memories
from further into the future.

03:35.586 --> 03:38.006
Things that're
still yet to come.

03:38.096 --> 03:40.506
Things you showed him.

03:40.596 --> 03:43.516
With a little help from you.

03:43.596 --> 03:45.396
If you hadn't dragged me
into his memories,

03:45.476 --> 03:47.146
I could never have
pulled it off.

03:47.226 --> 03:48.646
Thank you for that, Brother.

03:48.726 --> 03:51.816
[Gasps] He said things
wouldn't go my way.

03:51.896 --> 03:53.356
That you'd get
everything you wanted.

03:53.436 --> 03:56.656
So. Does that mean--?

03:56.736 --> 04:00.866
Yeah. It happened
around four years ago.

04:00.946 --> 04:05.456
Dad's visions of my own future
memories were revealed to me.

04:05.536 --> 04:07.706
What a sight to see.

04:12.416 --> 04:14.006
Founder Ymir!

04:14.086 --> 04:15.466
Take the ability to reproduce

04:15.546 --> 04:18.336
from every last
one of your subjects!

04:22.716 --> 04:25.306
[EREN gasps]
The Coordinate!

04:27.436 --> 04:29.606
[ZEKE]
You know what Grisha said to me?

04:29.686 --> 04:33.146
"Zeke, you have to
stop Eren. Please."

04:33.236 --> 04:36.646
Seems you left him saddled
with a great deal of regret.

04:38.906 --> 04:41.406
[ZEKE] I can't know
what all you've seen.

04:41.486 --> 04:43.196
How much of your
future you witnessed

04:43.286 --> 04:45.616
in Father's memories.

04:45.706 --> 04:46.706
But you can't have found out

04:46.786 --> 04:49.666
everything that's
in store for you.

04:49.746 --> 04:52.496
After all, you came here
without realizing

04:52.586 --> 04:55.546
that you wouldn't be able
to control the Founder.

04:56.876 --> 05:00.586
[ZEKE] Even now.
You're as powerless as ever.

05:00.676 --> 05:07.686
[EREN yelling]

05:13.106 --> 05:17.186
[Gasps] There's no point. Eren.

05:19.156 --> 05:22.526
Ymir has accepted her orders
and begun moving.

05:28.416 --> 05:31.786
[ZEKE] Nothing in this world
can stop her now.

05:31.956 --> 05:36.956
♪ Opening Song ♪

07:10.226 --> 07:12.386
[FRIEDA]
That's amazing, Historia!

07:12.476 --> 07:15.396
Just look at how well
you're able to read now!

07:15.476 --> 07:18.896
Thank you, but it's only 'cause
you're here to teach me.

07:18.976 --> 07:23.356
[FRIEDA] Ah.That runny nose of
yours needs some tending to.

07:23.446 --> 07:26.656
I guess next, I should teach you
how to act more ladylike.

07:26.736 --> 07:29.036
Here. Blow into this.

07:30.616 --> 07:34.876
Ooh! Goodness.
That's a job well done.

07:35.956 --> 07:38.126
--[HISTORIA] Hey.
--[FRIEDA] Hm?

07:38.206 --> 07:40.916
What's it mean to act ladylike?

07:41.006 --> 07:44.086
Uh-- Well. Let me think.

07:44.176 --> 07:47.296
I'm not exactly
an expert myself, but...

07:47.386 --> 07:50.806
I would say that the young lady
here in your book has it down.

07:50.886 --> 07:54.136
So. Is she one of
your favorite characters?

07:54.226 --> 07:55.346
[HISTORIA]
Mm-hm!

07:57.646 --> 07:59.356
[FRIEDA] She's always
thinking about others,

07:59.436 --> 08:02.356
and helping them out
in whatever way she can.

08:38.896 --> 08:40.146
[FRIEDA]
You'll find pain and suffering

08:40.226 --> 08:42.776
everywhere you look
in this world.

08:45.776 --> 08:48.276
[FRIEDA] So do your best
to make things better.

09:01.796 --> 09:04.796
[FRIEDA] Treat people with love
and they'll love you in return.

09:10.296 --> 09:12.346
[FRITZ]
A pig escaped.

09:12.426 --> 09:15.266
One of you allowed
that to happen.

09:15.346 --> 09:17.846
If they won't confess,
then I'll pluck an eye

09:17.936 --> 09:21.106
from each of your skulls
and call this settled.

09:21.186 --> 09:25.566
Slaves can easily go about
their work with one apiece.

09:35.826 --> 09:38.616
So you allowed my pig to escape?

09:57.476 --> 10:01.936
Then so be it.
I hereby set you free.

10:02.646 --> 10:09.656
[FOUNDER YMIR panting]

10:12.616 --> 10:13.736
[FOUNDER YMIR yelps]

10:37.096 --> 10:38.266
[Gasps]

10:52.066 --> 10:54.616
[Horse neighs]

11:10.456 --> 11:11.966
[Gasps]

12:00.426 --> 12:03.846
[Roars]

12:11.726 --> 12:13.606
[FRITZ]
My slave, Ymir.

12:13.686 --> 12:16.906
You have done such
great works in my name.

12:23.366 --> 12:26.456
You have carved out roads,
cultivated the hinterlands,

12:26.536 --> 12:28.916
and built bridges
spanning mountains.

12:28.996 --> 12:30.916
You have helped
the tribe of Eldia

12:30.996 --> 12:34.166
to become both
large and powerful.

12:35.216 --> 12:40.056
For all this, I shall
reward you with my seed.

12:41.806 --> 12:44.766
[FRITZ] The Marleyans
are our hated foes.

12:44.846 --> 12:46.556
In the name of Fritz,

12:46.646 --> 12:49.226
bring them death!

13:41.366 --> 13:43.656
[Inaudible]

13:50.286 --> 13:53.626
[Inaudible]

14:28.866 --> 14:30.616
What is the meaning of this?

14:30.706 --> 14:32.416
On your feet.

14:32.496 --> 14:35.456
My slave could never be
done in by a single spear.

14:35.546 --> 14:37.586
Of that I am certain.

14:37.666 --> 14:40.626
Now rise and do your work, Ymir.

14:56.276 --> 14:58.566
Do it. Feast, my daughters!

14:58.646 --> 15:01.356
We must bear Ymir's power
into the future,

15:01.446 --> 15:03.526
no matter the cost.

15:03.606 --> 15:07.736
Consume every scrap and
sinew of your mother's body.

15:07.826 --> 15:12.456
Maria. Rose. Sina.

15:18.086 --> 15:19.376
[FRITZ]
My daughters.

15:19.456 --> 15:22.586
You must give birth
and multiply.

15:22.676 --> 15:26.386
The blood of Ymir
has to live on.

15:26.466 --> 15:28.346
When you yourselves die,

15:28.426 --> 15:31.556
let my grandchildren
eat your spines.

15:31.636 --> 15:34.596
And let their children
eat their spines.

15:34.686 --> 15:38.396
So forth and so on. Forever!

16:21.606 --> 16:24.566
[FRITZ] Even after my passing,
my Eldians shall

16:24.656 --> 16:29.276
wield Ymir's power and reign
supreme all over the world.

16:29.366 --> 16:33.406
Our Titans will bring the people
of every land to heel.

16:33.496 --> 16:36.576
So long as this world persists,
our reign will--

16:36.666 --> 16:39.246
[EREN]
I'll end it! Here and now!

16:39.336 --> 16:43.296
I'll put an end to this world
if you give me your strength!

16:43.376 --> 16:46.426
You're nobody's slave
and you're no god, either!

16:46.506 --> 16:48.336
You're just a person!

16:48.426 --> 16:50.216
You don't have to serve anyone.

16:50.306 --> 16:52.176
You can make your own choices!

16:52.266 --> 16:53.676
This is your power.

16:53.766 --> 16:55.426
You get to decide!

16:55.516 --> 16:56.346
Do you wanna stay here...

16:56.436 --> 16:59.896
Wait, Eren. Stop it!

16:59.976 --> 17:01.776
You can't do this!

17:01.856 --> 17:03.896
What the hell are you thinking?

17:03.986 --> 17:06.486
Ymir! I gave you a command.

17:06.566 --> 17:08.816
You have to obey my will!

17:08.906 --> 17:12.156
You've been guiding me
this whole time, haven't you?

17:12.236 --> 17:15.406
[ZEKE] What are you waiting for?
Do it, Ymir!

17:15.496 --> 17:18.326
You've been all alone, waiting.

17:18.416 --> 17:22.836
[ZEKE] I'm descended from
Eldian royalty. Obey me!

17:22.916 --> 17:26.586
[EREN] Two thousand years,
for someone.

18:19.686 --> 18:22.306
[ALL gasp]

18:22.396 --> 18:23.726
[MAGATH screams]

18:23.816 --> 18:26.356
[Screams]

18:28.776 --> 18:30.026
[Gasps]

18:57.466 --> 19:03.476
[EREN TITAN roars]

19:04.766 --> 19:07.146
[REINER]
Gabi!

19:37.006 --> 19:38.766
[MIKASA]
What is that thing?

19:38.846 --> 19:40.596
It's gigantic.

19:40.676 --> 19:44.226
It looked like it materialized
from where Eren was.

19:44.306 --> 19:46.226
Could it be...

19:46.316 --> 19:49.566
Eren really did it. It's over!

19:49.646 --> 19:50.606
I can't hear you!

19:50.686 --> 19:52.566
The war is over and we won!

19:52.646 --> 19:53.646
Huh?

19:53.736 --> 19:55.486
Eren's using the power
of the Founder!

19:55.566 --> 19:56.736
[MIKASA gasps]

19:56.816 --> 19:59.036
That has to be why
the rumbling has started.

19:59.116 --> 20:01.036
This is what Eren
wanted all along.

20:01.116 --> 20:02.826
He's gonna send
these Titans to Marley

20:02.906 --> 20:06.286
and crush the global
military alliance!

20:06.376 --> 20:10.706
Eren's still our ally!
He always has been!

20:19.846 --> 20:21.516
Zeke, did you...?

20:25.136 --> 20:27.896
Eren. Are you still yourself?

20:27.976 --> 20:30.776
Have you really
come back to our side?

20:30.856 --> 20:34.236
Wait a second. What's going on?

20:34.316 --> 20:36.776
There's no way. He would never.

20:36.856 --> 20:37.696
Mikasa!

20:37.776 --> 20:39.116
[Gasps]

20:39.196 --> 20:42.116
[ARMIN] All the walls are
falling, even Wall Maria!

20:42.196 --> 20:45.156
But he doesn't need that many
Titans to attack Marley.

20:45.246 --> 20:47.666
This is complete overkill!

20:47.746 --> 20:50.706
Just the wall around Shiganshina
would be more than enough.

20:50.796 --> 20:53.756
He has no reason to give up
the walls completely.

20:53.836 --> 20:55.376
Not if the plan is
just to knock out

20:55.466 --> 20:57.336
the global alliance in Marley.

20:57.426 --> 21:00.176
So why do this?
What could he be--?

21:00.556 --> 21:03.636
[EREN]
Hear me. Subjects of Ymir.

21:04.806 --> 21:09.356
[MIKASA gasps] It's him.
That was Eren's voice!

21:09.436 --> 21:12.776
[EREN]
My name is Eren Jaeger.

21:12.856 --> 21:15.816
I'm addressing my fellow
Subjects of Ymir.

21:15.896 --> 21:19.736
Speaking to you directly through
the power of the Founder.

21:19.816 --> 21:21.946
All the walls
on the island of Paradis

21:22.036 --> 21:24.036
have crumbled to the ground,

21:24.116 --> 21:28.246
and the legions of Titans buried
within have begun their march.

21:29.286 --> 21:31.086
[EREN]
My only goal

21:31.166 --> 21:33.796
is to protect the lives of
the people of Paradis,

21:33.876 --> 21:36.166
the island where I was born.

21:37.086 --> 21:40.176
[EREN] Right now, the nations
of the world are united

21:40.556 --> 21:43.386
in their desire to
exterminate my people,

21:43.466 --> 21:46.016
and it won't end
with our island.

21:46.096 --> 21:47.726
They won't be satisfied until

21:47.806 --> 21:50.726
every last Subject
of Ymir is dead.

21:50.806 --> 21:54.226
I won't let them have their way.

21:54.316 --> 21:57.696
The Titans of the walls
will continue their march

21:57.776 --> 22:02.196
until every trace of life beyond
our shores is trampled flat,

22:02.276 --> 22:06.956
and the people of Paradis are
all that remains of humanity.

22:09.956 --> 22:14.956
♪ Ending Song ♪

23:41.416 --> 23:43.676
[NARRATOR]
The ground rumbles underfoot.

23:43.756 --> 23:46.216
A pillar of dust
touches the sky,

23:46.306 --> 23:49.466
heralding the horde of
Titans on the horizon.

23:49.556 --> 23:52.806
The walls of Paradis are gone.

23:52.886 --> 23:54.936
Next episode: "Thaw."
